ounded-xl bg-line sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:0ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->1<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Paste or upload</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">A draft, a DOCX, a PDF or an image. Text inside images is read too.</p></li><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:70ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->2<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Rules run first</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">Your banned phrases, required labels, product names, contrast and alt text, checked by code.</p></li><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:140ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->3<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Claims meet the facts</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">Every claim is matched to your fact ledger: supported, contradicted, expired or unsupported.</p></li><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:210ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->4<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Evidence or silence</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">A finding only shows if it names a real rule or fact and quotes your exact words.</p></li><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:280ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->5<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Fixed without inventing</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">Claims are fixed only with approved wording; your call to action and key phrases are kept.</p></li><li class="reveal group bg-panel p-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bone hover:text-carbon" style="transition-delay:350ms"><span class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-bone/45 group-hover:text-carbon/60">Step <!-- -->6<!-- --> of 6</span><h3 class="mt-2 font-display text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight">Reviewed and recorded</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70 group-hover:text-carbon/75">Reviewers decide, approvals are routed, and every step lands in a tamper-evident log.</p></li></ol></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-accent-brand px-5 py-24 text-white sm:px-8"><div aria-hidden="true" class="guides-dark pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"></div><div class="reveal relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-end gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr]" style="transition-delay:0ms"><div><p class="font-label text-xs font-semibold uppercase text-white/70">Tested, not claimed</p><h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem)] font-bold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.02em]">Finds <!-- -->31<!-- --> of <!-- -->33<!-- --> problems. A single AI prompt finds <!-- -->18<!-- -->.</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-white/80">On a <!-- -->40<!-- -->-post test set with frozen labels, again